Ever wondered how those beasts look like?  I found something for your
imagination in a book about prehistoric animals:

   Titanothere:  Imagine a rhino nine feet high.  That's exactly it.

   Baluchitherium:  Take a titanothere, remove the horn, and make the legs
   three feet longer (height 12 feet).  It has a length of 25 feet.
   It is well-known as the biggest mammal that ever lived on land.

Both lived 40-50 million years ago.

Now, wouldn't it be nice to have some dinosaurs in 3.1?
I would love to kill a Tyrannosaurus rex in the game!!!

